{"4886960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sporebound", "steam_appid": 4886960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A group of renowned adventurers set sail in search of answers to a growing corruption spreading across a remote chain of islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They never returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, a new band of heroes must follow in their footsteps. Journey across diverse islands, rescue the missing adventurers, uncover what happened to them, and piece together the trail leading to a powerful force responsible for twisting the creatures and landscapes of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether playing alone or with friends, every rescued adventurer reveals new clues, hidden knowledge, and fragments of a larger mystery. The closer you get to the truth, the more dangerous the journey becomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combine Elemental Magic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness powerful elemental forces and experiment with over <strong>160 unique spell combinations</strong>. Create new magical effects, overcome environmental obstacles, solve puzzles, and adapt your abilities to different enemies and situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/9031f1a81d1fa889354b9a329ec39dbf.poster.avif?t=1785151972\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/9031f1a81d1fa889354b9a329ec39dbf.webm?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/9031f1a81d1fa889354b9a329ec39dbf.mp4?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/a2ddff132ae8a9c317a479af21020027.poster.avif?t=1785151972\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/a2ddff132ae8a9c317a479af21020027.webm?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/a2ddff132ae8a9c317a479af21020027.mp4?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, collect and buy clothing from your favorite vendors, so that you can fight in fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/4ec7d36f9f65cceaeeb6cc8196f86fba.poster.avif?t=1785151972\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/4ec7d36f9f65cceaeeb6cc8196f86fba.webm?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/4ec7d36f9f65cceaeeb6cc8196f86fba.mp4?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/ad40912d5af9d23b286a7867b892f41e.poster.avif?t=1785151972\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/ad40912d5af9d23b286a7867b892f41e.webm?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/ad40912d5af9d23b286a7867b892f41e.mp4?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Mysterious Islands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through handcrafted islands filled with secrets, hidden paths, ancient ruins, and unique environmental challenges. Every island offers new discoveries and brings you one step closer to finding the missing adventurers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rescue Lost Adventurers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down explorers who disappeared during their expeditions. Each rescue expands the story, reveals valuable information, and helps uncover the identity of the force spreading corruption throughout the islands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Corrupted Creatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight creatures transformed by a mysterious blight. Learn their weaknesses, master your elemental abilities, and overcome powerful guardians protecting the darkest secrets of the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/88213840b888b8817684dd678a286aa9.poster.avif?t=1785151972\" width=480 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/88213840b888b8817684dd678a286aa9.webm?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/88213840b888b8817684dd678a286aa9.mp4?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/5829aca946e791d4b2f155e35279230e.poster.avif?t=1785151972\" width=480 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/5829aca946e791d4b2f155e35279230e.webm?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/5829aca946e791d4b2f155e35279230e.mp4?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Ancient Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect relics scattered throughout the world to strengthen your abilities, unlock new opportunities for exploration, and customize your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/2f70ac1dbe70347dbed7485d2a3815ca.poster.avif?t=1785151972\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/2f70ac1dbe70347dbed7485d2a3815ca.webm?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/2f70ac1dbe70347dbed7485d2a3815ca.mp4?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the Truth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the trail left behind by the missing adventurers and confront the source of the corruption before the islands are consumed completely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sporebound is a cooperative action-adventure that combines exploration, platforming, puzzle-solving, and elemental magic in a world filled with mystery, danger, and discovery.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A group of renowned adventurers set sail in search of answers to a growing corruption spreading across a remote chain of islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They never returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, a new band of heroes must follow in their footsteps. Journey across diverse islands, rescue the missing adventurers, uncover what happened to them, and piece together the trail leading to a powerful force responsible for twisting the creatures and landscapes of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether playing alone or with friends, every rescued adventurer reveals new clues, hidden knowledge, and fragments of a larger mystery. The closer you get to the truth, the more dangerous the journey becomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combine Elemental Magic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness powerful elemental forces and experiment with over <strong>160 unique spell combinations</strong>. Create new magical effects, overcome environmental obstacles, solve puzzles, and adapt your abilities to different enemies and situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/9031f1a81d1fa889354b9a329ec39dbf.poster.avif?t=1785151972\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/9031f1a81d1fa889354b9a329ec39dbf.webm?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/9031f1a81d1fa889354b9a329ec39dbf.mp4?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/a2ddff132ae8a9c317a479af21020027.poster.avif?t=1785151972\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/a2ddff132ae8a9c317a479af21020027.webm?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/a2ddff132ae8a9c317a479af21020027.mp4?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, collect and buy clothing from your favorite vendors, so that you can fight in fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_parag