nesses, master your elemental abilities, and overcome powerful guardians protecting the darkest secrets of the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/88213840b888b8817684dd678a286aa9.poster.avif?t=1785151972\" width=480 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/88213840b888b8817684dd678a286aa9.webm?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/88213840b888b8817684dd678a286aa9.mp4?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/5829aca946e791d4b2f155e35279230e.poster.avif?t=1785151972\" width=480 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/5829aca946e791d4b2f155e35279230e.webm?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/5829aca946e791d4b2f155e35279230e.mp4?t=1785151972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Ancient Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect relics scattered throughout the world to strengthen your abilities, unlock new opportunities for exploration, and customize your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/2f70ac1dbe70347dbed7485d2a3815ca.poster.avif?t=1785151972\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4886960/extras/2